{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f7e9dc678e189c6d4fe8d7fe16a3893cc932f17bc8fa67c34f36d26a6f1116a", "ja": "（今日は千鶴さんと、ビアホールに来ている。CMに\n出演した商品の宣伝で、1日店員さん体験の仕事だ）", "zh": "（今天和千鹤小姐一起来到了啤酒大厅。这次的工作是为她出演广告的商品做宣传，并体验当1天店员。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "99f16434670eb9ff6acdd9de3ae3539f509076afa4df1992680f870f08744fe1", "ja": "お待たせいたしました！　クラフトビール3つと\nソーセージの盛り合わせ、それとトンカツ……。", "zh": "让您久等了！精酿啤酒3杯、香肠拼盘，还有炸猪排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "766cdd33adad21285599357fd7cb1167f1d5dccf4b9568149ca8c5c522b58ef9", "ja": "ではなく！\n当店の名物、シュニッツェルになりますわ！", "zh": "才不是！是本店的招牌菜——炸肉排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "ec0c6128200bdf7758cdc417cfddfb8a5b00775b399847b6aaebac9b3dbe840e", "ja": "お客様方、オーダーはすべてそろいまして？\nそれではごゆっくりお楽しみくださいまし！", "zh": "各位客人，点的餐都上齐了吗？\n那么，请慢慢享用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1004_p", "source_sha256": "80259d8800807cd32c52836835391e0aa8a9d086b3c22b55ab4a2de8dedb9e15", "ja": "（手際よく注文をさばき、しっかり片付けまで……\n千鶴さんらしい配慮もあり、すごい活躍だ）", "zh": "（麻利地处理订单，还认真收拾到最后……又有着千鹤式的体贴，表现得真是太棒了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1005_null", "source_sha256": "8d1d9bdc4119817f8929f28407d13054bf5c28098d7adfd7377a2379ec2be02c", "ja": "1日体験　終了後……", "zh": "1日体验 结束之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "534c06649e8b782b608ae8e3a35a1e4e8a3b7815bc515c2c357cb72b05402c19", "ja": "千鶴さん、お疲れ様でした。\n店員さん姿も、様になっていましたよ。", "zh": "千鹤小姐，辛苦了。\n您穿店员服的样子也很有模有样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "3c9d5feb81c0c3694a7ed1fc68c1e3ab78885e307dcae99f13fa267ac692e873", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nふぅ……すっかり夢中で働いてしまいましたわ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n呼……一不小心就完全投入到工作中了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d4bab2a0438148ba26346cf90a0de7078779b1d1e41c5581421e7bc494f354f5", "ja": "はい、楽しんでいるのがすごく伝わってきました。\n先方も、宣伝は大成功だと喜んでいましたよ！", "zh": "是的，我能很明显地感受到您乐在其中。对方也很高兴地说，这次宣传非常成功呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "d905c2bdf1ef30ed95fdc7ced596acf939c42bcddbb548ae2678ff8d63464af8", "ja": "まぁ、それならよかったですわ！　クライアントも\nお客様も楽しんでくださったなら、何よりですわね。", "zh": "哎呀，那真是太好了！只要客户和\n客人们都玩得尽兴，那就比什么都强了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "36ac42a592a561c8776d6445be93daac963451f3cd28d53193a22694004ece14", "ja": "わたくしも、このお店の雰囲気が、\n商店街の居酒屋さんと……。", "zh": "我也觉得，这家店的氛围，\n和商店街的居酒屋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "40514af3716a9b871316a2534a3cefd2c3c5db6e62646dfbe518209de0e45c9d", "ja": "ではなく！　その、ドイツへ旅行した時に行った、\n商店街の小さな居酒屋さんに似ているんですのよ！？", "zh": "不是！我是说，它很像我去德国旅行时光顾过的，那家商店街里的小居酒屋！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1012_p", "source_sha256": "37b599d7b31de425981303a97f43123c110e492e60ac42ac47e45b4bb9bc4964", "ja": "ドイツはビールの本場ですからね！\nわかります。", "zh": "德国可是啤酒的故乡嘛！我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4477700e8e1e46874ae3f886dd3dd4c9e3eda0ddb62ec4ecfa69dee50f686eeb", "ja": "そういえば、千鶴さんがお酒を飲む姿は、\nあまり見た事がありませんね。", "zh": "说起来，我好像没怎么见过千鹤小姐喝酒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "1baeabcab880d08d71cfb08a1cbd1e3ceb231cfbcae50a0bbc317df0cdce7957", "ja": "そうですわね。お酒は、嗜む程度ですのよ。\nけど、それがどうかしたんですの？", "zh": "是这样呢。我只是适量饮酒而已。\n不过，那又怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6d27ab948fa50df13dab8a471721650ef6aaf892983df9487d766b53035b9244", "ja": "それが、ここのギフト券をもらったんです。\n千鶴さんが頑張ってくれたお礼にと。", "zh": "是这样的，我收到了这里的礼券。说是为了感谢千鹤小姐的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "3e770698aa4a5c7eaf7ae3a8fe46b12b9d32df3c4ba5541cd473e6a1777bcf5f", "ja": "まぁ、そうでしたの？　なら{$P$}、\nさっそく使わせていただくというのはどうかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？那么{$P$}，\n我们不妨现在就用掉它，您意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1017_p", "source_sha256": "54c83aad8c8796c116e6036e9908a515ce15c2e07c37e66f1900e2b36f16a501", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "9c6b8f6b919cb6636b64431dda89ea8b7639e41de6d9bfae76a91187ff659be7", "ja": "ええ。ひとりでお酒をいただくことはありませんが、\n一緒に飲んでくださる相手がいるなら、話は別です。", "zh": "是的。虽然我不会一个人喝酒，\n但如果有愿意陪我一起喝的人，那就另当别论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "a4e92de28a576704475d35a0c1c0e3e6bff60e4e993cbbc9eb56eb7cce83b5b8", "ja": "今日一日、付き添ってくださったことですし……。\n{$P$}、いかが？", "zh": "今天陪了我一整天……{$P$}，要不要一起喝一杯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1020_p", "source_sha256": "624a700a3f278075635b72e8bc0426916a91d9fb953a4943dd1d129c924d158a", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nではお言葉に甘えて、お付き合いさせて頂きます。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n那我就恭敬不如从命，奉陪到底了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "0e916ee1c56afc6abd8cdc2a5e702c9e38ddc112bef67b8335b63a9441e01b3b", "ja": "ふふっ、決まりですわね♪\nそれでは、わたくしは着替えて参りますわ。", "zh": "呵呵，这就说定了♪\n那么，我先去换身衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "dc7f0d1bd5ede1f82475992e65018191efdc3f9cc0bcf5b396f396df7488837a", "ja": "あっ。わたくしが戻るまで、飲まないでくださいまし？\nきちんと、乾杯したいですから。ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊。在我回来之前，请先不要喝哦？\n因为我想好好地和您干杯。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0274_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3e1ae131b16a830b4b2fa6b29e46dc17c421515ccfe448e01a086a218a9b79fe", "ja": "（一仕事終えた後の千鶴さんの笑顔は、爽やかだった。\n今日は楽しく飲んでもらえるといいな）", "zh": "（忙完一件工作后的千鹤小姐，笑容格外清爽。希望她今天能开心地喝酒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
